/*
 * lzexpand.rc - LZEXPAND.DLL's version resource, written by tools/mkver.py
 * (the Makefile; OpenWatcom's 16-bit VERSIONINFO is not readable by 3.1's
 * VER.DLL). The numbers are 3.1's (3.10.0.103, read with tools/neres.py:
 * programs check the library's version, SDK Vol. 1 ch. 9), the texts
 * w16's (ARCHITECTURE.md 3).
 */
1 16 MOVEABLE PURE "lzver.bin"
